@ukraine_soviet_results
title: All-Ukrainian Congress of Soviets
new-page: true
view-if: ukrainian_congress_timer = 0 and ukrainian_congresses = 0 and month != 11
tags: event

= Ukrainian Congress of Soviets

Delegates are gathering for the All-Ukrainian Congress of Soviets. However, there appears to be a major problem regarding the congress composition. The other parties have participated in force, leading to a less than favorable outcome in the election results to begin with. Then, while the Ukrainian Bolsheviks had pushed for "delegation quotas", in the hopes of creating a manageable majority at the congress, it appears many soviets have openly disregarded this. At the instigation of the other parties, soviets have flooded the congress with additional delegates, and in particular, peasant and soldier organizations have been urged to send as many delegates as possible. 

- @proceed_election : How bad could it be? 

@proceed_election
on-arrival: {! Q.election_provinces = 'ukraine'; !}
go-to: election_algorithm.soviet
set-jump: election_results

@election_results
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!

Q.ukrainian_congresses += 1;
Q.ukrainian_ca_timer = 36; 

Q.anarchist_election_votes_dec += 0.2;
Q.maximalist_election_votes_dec += 0.6;
Q.b_election_votes_dec -= 26.4;
Q.sdi_election_votes_dec -= 1;
Q.right_m_election_votes_dec -= 0.1;
Q.ukrainian_sd_election_votes_dec -= 3.3;
Q.bundist_election_votes_dec -= 2.2;
Q.lsr_election_votes_dec -= 0;
Q.sr_election_votes_dec -= 0; 
Q.ukrainian_sr_election_votes_dec -= 5;
Q.popular_socialist_election_votes_dec -= 0; 
Q.agrarian_election_votes_dec += 22;
Q.polish_election_votes_dec -= 0.5;
Q.zionist_election_votes_dec -= 0.7;
Q.other_election_votes_dec += 18;

if (Q.sr_election_votes_dec < 2) { Q.sr_election_votes_dec += 1; Q.b_election_votes_dec -= 1; }
if (Q.sdi_election_votes_dec < 0.2) { Q.sdi_election_votes_dec += 0.2; Q.b_election_votes_dec -= 0.2; }
if (Q.m_election_votes_dec < 0.4) { Q.m_election_votes_dec += 0.2; Q.b_election_votes_dec -= 0.2; }
if (Q.right_m_election_votes_dec < 0.1) { Q.right_m_election_votes_dec += 0.1; Q.b_election_votes_dec -= 0.1; }
if (Q.popular_socialist_election_votes_dec < 0.3) { Q.popular_socialist_election_votes_dec += 0.3; Q.b_election_votes_dec -= 0.3; }

if (Q.ukraine_preparations > 0) { Q.b_election_votes_dec += (Q.ukraine_preparations / 2 ); Q.other_election_votes_dec -= (Q.ukraine_preparations / 2 ); }


window.mapElectionNormalize();

Q.coalition1 = Math.round(100*(Q.anarchist_election_votes_dec + Q.maximalist_election_votes_dec + Q.b_election_votes_dec + Q.lsr_election_votes_dec + (Q.other_election_votes_dec * 0.1)))/100;
Q.coalition2 = Math.round(100*((Q.maximalist_election_votes_dec * 0.75) + Q.ukrainian_sd_election_votes_dec + Q.bundist_election_votes_dec + (Q.lsr_election_votes_dec * 0.75) + Q.sr_election_votes_dec + Q.ukrainian_sr_election_votes_dec + Q.popular_socialist_election_votes_dec + Q.agrarian_election_votes_dec + Q.other_election_votes_dec))/100;
Q.coalition3 = Math.round(100*((Q.anarchist_election_votes_dec * 0.5) + (Q.maximalist_election_votes_dec*0.3) + Q.b_election_votes_dec + Q.lsr_election_votes_dec + (Q.other_election_votes_dec * 0.3)))/100;

if (typeof Q.election_seat_total != 'number' || Q.election_seat_total <= 0) {
    Q.election_seat_total = 2420;
}
for (var party of Q.election_parties) {
    Q[party + '_election_r'] = Math.round(Q.election_seat_total * (Q[party + '_election_votes_dec'] || 0) / 100);
}
!}
on-display: {!
var data = [];
var rows = '<tr><th>Party</th><th>Vote Share</th></tr>';
for (var party of Q.election_parties) {
    var label = window.electionNames[party];
    var box = label.box || party;
    data.push({"id": party, "legend": label.legend, "name": label.legend, "seats": Q[party + '_election_r']});
    rows += '<tr><td><div class="party-box box ' + box + '"></div>' + label.table + '</td><td>' + (Q[party + '_election_votes_dec'] || 0) + '%</td></tr>';
}
data.forEach(function(d) {
    if (!Number.isFinite(d.seats)) {
        console.error("BAD SEAT VALUE", d.id, d.seats);
    }
});
document.getElementById("election_table").innerHTML = rows;
if (window && d3) {
    var width = 625;
    var height = 625;
    var screenWidth = document.getElementById('content').offsetWidth;
    if (screenWidth < width - 50) {
        width = screenWidth - 50;
        height = width;
        document.getElementById("election_chart").style.height = width + "px";
    }
    var parliament = d3.parliament();
    parliament.width(width).height(height).innerRadiusCoef(0.4);
    parliament.enter.fromCenter(true).smallToBig(true);
    parliament.exit.toCenter(false).bigToSmall(true);
    d3.select("#election_chart").datum(data).call(parliament);
}
!}

= Ukrainian Congress of Soviets

{!<svg id="election_chart" viewBox="0 0 625 310"> </svg>!}

{!<table id="election_table" class="soviet-table"></table>!}

As it turns out, vastly more people than expected have attended the congress, and we're in a significant minority. We'll have to choose our actions very carefully here...

- @bolshevik_coalition
- @agrarian_coalition


@bolshevik_coalition
title: [+ coalition1 +]% — Can we form a pro-Bolshevik congress presidium? 
choose-if: coalition1 > 50
unavailable_subtitle: The proposal is drowned out by the booing of the mob. 

@agrarian_coalition
title: [+ coalition2 +]% — The Ukrainian nationalist and agrarian parties dominate!
subtitle: The presidium is controlled by the <span style="color: var(--usr); font-weight: bold;">USRs</span>, <span style="color: var(--sr); font-weight: bold;">SRs</span>, <span style="color: var(--agrarian); font-weight: bold;">Agrarians</span>, and others. 
choose-if: coalition2 > 50
go-to: congress_events


@congress_events
new-page: true

= Ukrainian Congress of Soviets

With the presidium in the hands of pro-Central Rada forces, our delegates struggle to get a word in. The congress descends into chaotic debate, although it's clear that the assembly generally leans in favor of the Kyiv government and against Bolshevik control.

- @conference
- @agrarian_agenda

@conference
title: Due to the delegation irregularities, let's push to have the congress reclassified as a non-binding "conference"; then we can hold new elections. 
unavailable_subtitle: [+ coalition3 +]% — We lack the strength for this. 
choose-if: coalition3 > 50

@agrarian_agenda
title: The majority proceeds with their agenda...

The Congress votes to affirm the previous universals of the Central Rada, placing its full weight behind the actions of the incumbent government, and approving their harsh response to Bolshevik forces. It seems our strategy has backfired, as now the Central Rada can point to an official sanction from the soviets for its actions. 

- @walkout

@walkout
title: All we can do now is walk-out and refuse to recognize this illegitimate assembly! 
go-to: root




